OL,3,GNEWSAReward of #20k offered to help
OL,4,Afind woman's killer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reward of up to #20,000 is being
OL,7,Foffered for information related to the
OL,8,Fkilling of a 58-year-old woman whose
OL,9,Fbody was found in an outbuilding.
OL,11,FJanna Fuller's body was found at a
OL,12,Fproperty she owned in Ettrick Court,
OL,13,FFarnborough, on 27 July.
OL,15,FThe Crimestoppers reward is for anyone
OL,16,Fwith information to come forward
OL,17,Fanonymously. The charity said "no piece
OL,18,Fof information is too small, and it
OL,19,Fcould be the vital detail that helps
OL,20,Fbring those responsible to justice".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
